WEBVTT

00:07.100 --> 00:10.700
Please eat up, everyone!

00:12.840 --> 00:14.710
It looks delicious!

00:15.910 --> 00:19.550
Is it okay for them to be treating us to all this?

00:19.550 --> 00:20.820
No kidding...

00:20.820 --> 00:23.320
Armadole only fell over on those guys, after all.

00:23.320 --> 00:26.050
Oh, come on, Zed, that's just cruel.

00:28.790 --> 00:31.660
This is our thanks to you for
helping us out the other day.

00:31.660 --> 00:36.430
Besides, we've just received our wages,
and Jeeves helped pay too.

00:36.430 --> 00:38.830
That's right, so don't worry, just dig in!

00:38.830 --> 00:40.870
Think nothing of it!

00:40.870 --> 00:43.930
Really? Then I'm going to do just as you say!

00:47.240 --> 00:49.640
Go on, Zed, you eat up too.

00:51.180 --> 00:52.610
Right...

00:52.610 --> 00:54.620
What's wrong, Zed?

00:54.620 --> 00:56.180
Nothing...

00:56.180 --> 00:58.890
Hello, and welcome!

00:58.890 --> 01:03.990
Our establishment is currently holding a
special Tenth Anniversary promotion.

01:03.990 --> 01:08.120
One and only one of your group may
participate in our lottery drawing.

01:09.260 --> 01:11.700
Hey, Zed, why don't you give it a try?

01:11.700 --> 01:13.940
Yeah, give it a try!

01:13.940 --> 01:15.040
Me?

01:15.040 --> 01:16.660
Sure!

01:21.580 --> 01:23.810
Congratulations!

01:23.810 --> 01:27.680
You win a full year's supply of white bread!

01:27.680 --> 01:29.550
Br..Bread?

01:33.390 --> 01:35.450
Oh, no, Zed!

01:41.000 --> 01:42.960
What's wrong, Zed?!

01:44.630 --> 01:46.660
He's burning up!

02:02.650 --> 02:10.260
Far away from the town where I was born

02:10.260 --> 02:13.430
I am singing

02:13.430 --> 02:21.070
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

02:21.070 --> 02:24.340
Away in my pocket

02:24.340 --> 02:29.880
Toward where I hear someone calling me

02:29.880 --> 02:34.920
Toward the unknown road

02:34.920 --> 02:40.360
I'll walk

02:40.360 --> 02:45.760
I'll move forward

02:45.760 --> 02:50.600
Not for someone else's sake

02:50.600 --> 02:56.070
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

02:56.070 --> 03:01.540
Just as the sun rises at dawn

03:01.540 --> 03:06.780
I pick out a melody with my voice

03:06.780 --> 03:10.810
Ephemerally yet strongly

03:12.450 --> 03:15.980
I live

03:21.630 --> 03:25.430
Episode 33
Lost Luster

03:33.840 --> 03:35.210
Oh, I hate this!

03:35.210 --> 03:37.080
I can't play it any good!

03:38.710 --> 03:41.250
Now, Sagiri, you mustn't give up like that.

03:41.250 --> 03:45.210
You'll be playing for Holy Father Hyrum at the
Foundation Day celebration, won't you?

03:47.520 --> 03:49.650
Well, I don't want to.

03:50.890 --> 03:53.190
Now that's no way to talk.

03:53.190 --> 03:54.990
Let me see it.

04:20.690 --> 04:22.490
He's good...

04:28.100 --> 04:31.260
I'd like to hear you play well too.

04:32.570 --> 04:34.190
But...

04:35.200 --> 04:37.040
You'll be fine.

04:37.040 --> 04:40.010
I just know you'll learn how to play well.

04:40.940 --> 04:42.740
You mean it?

04:42.740 --> 04:43.750
Okay!

04:43.750 --> 04:48.720
Then, I'll do my best so I can play for you,
not Holy Father Hyrum!

04:48.720 --> 04:50.510
What am I going to do with you?

04:51.150 --> 04:52.990
Are you there, Noah?

04:52.990 --> 04:54.260
Yes!

04:54.260 --> 04:56.220
Holy Father Hyrum wishes to see you.

04:57.060 --> 04:58.690
Understood.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.330
See you later, Sagiri.

05:02.330 --> 05:04.300
Get in some practice now.

05:05.230 --> 05:07.030
See you later.

05:16.180 --> 05:18.410
Doesn't seem to be a cold or anything.

05:18.410 --> 05:20.210
What could be wrong with him?

05:20.550 --> 05:22.050
If it were just a fever,

05:22.050 --> 05:25.280
the healing shards should have
taken care of it right away.

05:41.340 --> 05:42.960
Amir Gaul...

05:47.880 --> 05:50.000
Amir Gaul!

05:54.180 --> 05:55.980
Oh, Zed! You're awake!

05:58.720 --> 06:00.520
Thank goodness.

06:02.860 --> 06:03.990
It was a dream?

06:03.990 --> 06:06.190
Are you okay? How are you feeling?

06:06.190 --> 06:09.060
Yeah, I'm all right.

06:09.060 --> 06:11.050
I'll go get you some water.

06:20.380 --> 06:23.070
Why can't I feel Amir Gaul?

06:24.650 --> 06:26.610
What the heck has happened?

06:31.350 --> 06:32.550
We will soon hold a ceremony

06:32.550 --> 06:38.190
in celebration of the tenth year of my rule
and the founding of our nation.

06:38.190 --> 06:43.200
I would like to leave you two in charge of
security here in the capital during the event.

06:43.200 --> 06:45.270
Security during the ceremony?

06:45.270 --> 06:47.670
It would be an honor.

06:47.670 --> 06:53.700
You are both aware of the attempt Ulvarx made
on Holy Father Hyrum's life the other day?

06:54.110 --> 06:57.410
Die, Hyrum!

07:03.020 --> 07:04.120
There is a chance

07:04.120 --> 07:08.820
that our system to defend against enemy
encroachment has been compromised.

07:08.820 --> 07:12.390
We therefore have all the more need
for the tightest security.

07:12.390 --> 07:14.630
I will leave troop deployment to the two of you.

07:14.630 --> 07:16.800
Please confer with each other
and decide what to do.

07:16.800 --> 07:22.240
Bear in mind the feelings of our citizens who will
be there to celebrate our nation's founding.

07:22.240 --> 07:24.740
I am fully counting on you.

07:24.740 --> 07:26.540
Yes, Your Holiness.

07:30.910 --> 07:34.050
What is the latest development concerning Zed?

07:34.050 --> 07:37.140
I have already dispatched soldiers into Templar.

07:38.920 --> 07:41.420
But are you certain about this?

07:41.420 --> 07:44.760
There is the promise you previously
made to Master Zico...

07:44.760 --> 07:46.160
Promise?

07:46.160 --> 07:49.720
I do not recall making any promises to him.

07:53.030 --> 07:56.670
He and I are done with each other.

07:56.670 --> 08:00.110
We have gone our separate ways.

08:10.020 --> 08:13.690
Brian's and Alec's squads will cover
the north side of the castle.

08:13.690 --> 08:17.960
Chavez, I want you to spread out your
troops along the western beach.

08:17.960 --> 08:20.230
My squad will take up positions

08:20.230 --> 08:24.400
at the first defensive wall's east gate
and around the cathedral.

08:24.400 --> 08:28.600
Noah, I would like to leave the area
around the south gate to you.

08:28.600 --> 08:30.230
No.

08:30.640 --> 08:33.910
My squad will cover the east gate.

08:33.910 --> 08:35.440
Why?

08:35.440 --> 08:40.410
If the enemy does attack, it is highly
likely they will take that route.

08:40.410 --> 08:43.520
My squad will cover the riskier area.

08:43.520 --> 08:46.540
Do you mean to say that I am too weak to do so?!

08:48.420 --> 08:50.220
That is not what I meant.

08:50.220 --> 08:52.220
Then, what did you mean?

09:12.650 --> 09:13.780
Kira!

09:13.780 --> 09:15.750
About the deployment of our squads...

09:19.750 --> 09:21.290
What?

09:21.290 --> 09:23.090
It's nothing...

09:23.090 --> 09:24.160
What is it?

09:24.160 --> 09:26.590
Why don't you just spit it out?

09:27.400 --> 09:31.660
I was just thinking that you're more
attractive without your glasses.

09:33.670 --> 09:37.930
What, do you think I'm overjoyed to hear that?

09:38.340 --> 09:40.510
Spare me this nonsense!

09:40.510 --> 09:42.040
Kira...

09:42.040 --> 09:45.910
In any case, I will have my troops take up
positions according to my own plan.

09:45.910 --> 09:47.880
Know to expect that.

09:57.190 --> 09:59.850
We've known each other for some time now.

10:00.660 --> 10:02.560
Lady Diana?

10:02.560 --> 10:05.530
This is the first I've time seen you
with that kind of expression.

10:06.430 --> 10:08.240
This is not at all like you.

10:08.240 --> 10:10.170
What do you mean?

10:10.170 --> 10:13.770
Do not forget that Noah is our savior.

10:15.110 --> 10:19.510
Even if you do have special feelings for him.

10:19.510 --> 10:21.120
R..Ridiculous!

10:21.120 --> 10:24.750
I have never been moved by any man!

10:24.750 --> 10:26.950
And I don't see it happening any time soon.

10:43.870 --> 10:47.610
Please, grant me your assistance.

10:47.610 --> 10:51.110
Our forces are already organized.

10:51.110 --> 10:56.550
With Tusk's help,
we can surely conquer Neotopia.

10:56.550 --> 10:59.040
Who is commanding Zymot's army?

10:59.950 --> 11:05.930
I intend to personally march into Neotopia,
in command of all forces.

11:05.930 --> 11:07.460
I see.

11:07.460 --> 11:13.600
If you are so fully resolved,
then who are we to refuse you?

11:13.600 --> 11:16.570
Wouldn't you agree, Your Majesty?

11:17.710 --> 11:19.440
Naturally.

11:19.440 --> 11:22.100
As for our commanding officer...

11:22.910 --> 11:27.980
The king of Zymot says that he shall personally
lead his army into combat.

11:27.980 --> 11:33.120
It would therefore follow that our own king
should personally lead our army.

11:33.120 --> 11:35.360
You mean me?

11:35.360 --> 11:38.560
The King of Tusk himself will command
a force of beastmen

11:38.560 --> 11:41.460
in this joint attack on Neotopia.

11:41.460 --> 11:43.860
I trust there are no objections?

11:44.530 --> 11:46.660
My thanks.

11:56.580 --> 11:59.050
What is Tusk's response?

11:59.050 --> 12:03.040
Gari will cooperate by commanding
a horde of beastmen.

12:05.850 --> 12:09.810
The things you've been doing lately
seem a little out of character.

12:10.830 --> 12:14.320
What's got you in such a rush, Hugh?

12:21.440 --> 12:27.900
I was supposed to obtain all the key spirits
and become ruler of the world.

12:28.340 --> 12:32.010
But this is not to say I've given up,

12:32.010 --> 12:35.310
even if I have been rejected by Amir Gaul!

12:43.260 --> 12:47.730
If I cannot have them, I'll just smash them!

12:47.730 --> 12:49.750
All of them!

12:54.540 --> 12:55.200
Hey!

12:55.200 --> 12:56.830
Mom!
Hey!

13:11.790 --> 13:13.410
Noah!

13:17.730 --> 13:19.760
Well? Have you gotten better?

13:19.760 --> 13:22.830
Yeah, the teacher complimented me.

13:22.830 --> 13:24.130
Is that right?

13:24.130 --> 13:27.230
Well then, would you play a little for me?

13:27.230 --> 13:28.860
Sure!

14:04.210 --> 14:06.770
Yep, you've improved quite a bit!

14:07.340 --> 14:08.740
Noah!

14:08.740 --> 14:10.080
Kira?

14:10.080 --> 14:12.410
What do you think you're doing here?

14:12.410 --> 14:16.780
As a matter of security, this place
is off-limits after sundown.

14:16.780 --> 14:18.850
You are both in violation of Absolute Law!

14:18.850 --> 14:22.560
I was just listening to Sagiri's harmonica for a bit.

14:22.560 --> 14:24.020
We'll leave right away.

14:24.020 --> 14:25.760
Come on, Sagiri.

14:25.760 --> 14:27.390
Okay...

14:33.800 --> 14:36.570
It's like Lady Diana said.

14:36.570 --> 14:39.870
Why am I getting so upset?

14:42.180 --> 14:43.800
Noah...

14:44.610 --> 14:46.180
That woman back there...

14:46.180 --> 14:48.920
What, you mean Kira?

14:48.920 --> 14:52.220
She's an excellent shard caster.

14:52.220 --> 14:56.380
She and I will be managing security at
the Foundation Day celebration.

14:58.230 --> 15:00.320
She was pretty.

15:21.980 --> 15:26.080
I was just thinking that you're more
attractive without your glasses.

15:29.520 --> 15:31.150
Ridiculous!

15:35.360 --> 15:39.270
About the crime you and Zed have
supposedly committed

15:39.270 --> 15:41.790
in violation of Neotopia's Absolute Law...

15:44.070 --> 15:48.980
Hyrum has promised me that
he will let the matter slide.

15:48.980 --> 15:52.240
There is no longer anything
for you to worry about.

15:53.250 --> 15:55.620
Thank you so much!

15:55.620 --> 15:59.020
Let Zed know as soon as you can.

15:59.020 --> 16:00.820
Yes, sir!

16:15.500 --> 16:18.210
It's not like he disappeared on me.

16:18.210 --> 16:20.260
The shard is definitely here.

16:21.910 --> 16:23.880
But I can't feel him.

16:29.750 --> 16:31.550
Who's there?

16:36.620 --> 16:39.150
You're Neotopia's...

16:39.760 --> 16:41.460
Put away your sword.

16:41.460 --> 16:44.470
We have not come to fight you.

16:44.470 --> 16:46.030
What?

16:46.030 --> 16:49.870
There is someone in Neotopia
who wishes to see you.

16:49.870 --> 16:51.670
See me?

16:54.270 --> 16:55.610
Is it Noah?

16:55.610 --> 16:57.810
You will find out soon enough.

16:57.810 --> 16:59.610
Come with us.

16:59.610 --> 17:00.680
Forget it.

17:00.680 --> 17:01.750
What?

17:01.750 --> 17:03.750
Tell Noah if he wants to see me,

17:03.750 --> 17:06.480
then to come himself.

17:07.290 --> 17:09.380
No choice, eh?

17:14.400 --> 17:16.430
We'll take you by force if need be.

17:16.430 --> 17:21.490
We cannot allow those who have violated
Absolute Law to go free.

17:22.270 --> 17:24.170
Why you...

17:31.910 --> 17:34.180
No way! Zed!

17:38.350 --> 17:39.980
Zed!

17:41.120 --> 17:44.150
What? Zed has what?!

17:44.690 --> 17:48.130
I'm certain those were Neotopian soldiers!

17:48.130 --> 17:50.400
I saw them clearly with my own eyes!

17:50.400 --> 17:51.570
That can't be!

17:51.570 --> 17:53.270
There must be some kind of mistake here.

17:53.270 --> 17:54.890
But...

17:55.440 --> 17:58.840
Very well, I will go to Hyrum again and...

17:59.340 --> 18:00.640
Master Zico!

18:00.640 --> 18:01.780
What is it?

18:01.780 --> 18:04.610
We just received word from Neotopia!

18:04.610 --> 18:09.680
They have strictly forbidden Elder Zico
from setting foot on Neotopian soil!

18:09.680 --> 18:11.290
What did you say?!

18:11.290 --> 18:12.910
Zed's...

18:13.720 --> 18:18.210
Just what does Hyrum think he's doing?!

18:24.630 --> 18:26.530
How long do you plan to stay here?

18:26.530 --> 18:30.240
Isn't it high time we returned to Ulvarx?

18:30.240 --> 18:33.310
No! We failed to assassinate Hyrum.

18:33.310 --> 18:35.780
We can't just shamelessly return like this!

18:35.780 --> 18:37.240
Helic...

18:37.240 --> 18:39.970
I cannot give up!

18:40.780 --> 18:43.410
But staying here isn't...

18:48.160 --> 18:49.950
What's that?

19:03.940 --> 19:05.310
I don't believe this guy!

19:05.310 --> 19:08.600
How could he sic his spirit on us mid-shift?!

19:12.480 --> 19:14.210
Morpheus!

19:40.770 --> 19:42.570
Prepare to die!

19:52.450 --> 19:54.250
He is certainly strong!

19:54.250 --> 19:56.050
In that case...

20:01.090 --> 20:02.720
Amir Gaul!

20:03.900 --> 20:05.690
No good after all?

20:13.810 --> 20:17.330
If I'm not mistaken, that's Zed from Templar!

20:18.180 --> 20:19.810
Rambos!

20:34.830 --> 20:36.800
It can't be!

20:38.830 --> 20:40.630
He's strong.

20:41.100 --> 20:45.800
But why doesn't he use Amir Gaul?

20:53.110 --> 20:54.810
Morpheus!

21:06.030 --> 21:09.660
I cannot allow anyone in violation of
Absolute Law to go free!

21:10.860 --> 21:13.590
Absolute Law, Absolute Law...

21:14.200 --> 21:17.170
You guys just don't know when to
give it a rest with that crap!

22:11.830 --> 22:14.830
You're Zed from Templar, aren't you?

22:14.830 --> 22:16.460
Yeah...

22:17.060 --> 22:18.830
Do you remember me?

22:18.830 --> 22:22.830
I'm Helic, I fought for Ulvarx in the Joust.

22:25.570 --> 22:28.340
Yeah, I remember.

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Even if we've been far apart

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Our hearts are still connected

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
And always will be, even to the end of time

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:09.680
My old days

23:09.680 --> 23:12.050
Living it up on the weekend as always

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Just simply having fun, innocently

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days, gone in the blink of an eye

23:19.760 --> 23:22.130
Since then, we've gone our separate ways

23:22.130 --> 23:24.030
Chasing our own goals

23:24.030 --> 23:25.030
We grow up

23:25.030 --> 23:26.700
Tuck our memories in our hearts, and wave

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Fix our eyes on where we're going

23:27.870 --> 23:29.870
Neither of us will give up

23:29.870 --> 23:31.510
Knowing the other's fighting just as hard

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
I don't mind if you're not near me

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
I want to see your smile, but it's not the time

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
The more I look back

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
The more I tell myself I'll show this to you one day

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
That will never change

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Even if we've been far apart

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Our hearts are still connected

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
And always will be, even to the end of time

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

24:17.880 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
War Breaks Out

24:17.980 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "War Breaks Out"
